_order":null,"call_locator":"fc38a86d3f7381893f2c01f7765b312a45512eb724bd1f8862a7ddb76ae795c7","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"5b3426128ac2d3767f6221452e8e60e523d4f4e7893c90ea6f6a0254e62c8540","logical_entry_identity":"1c13be162beee340920073aef55cfc0aa2a80571a6de82dd907e156931b75c1a","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"fire repulsion","source_tag":"damage type","target":"火焰排斥"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"4fdf123e88d004cbd9cc30fa67a4046df7b283af3e01daf298c9f57f0dc61464","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"5b3d83ed3cac08d950ae16e2f8adf522aa93a9000b16ae9ce86f4b4c8d141330","logical_entry_identity":"687e596a08976c3fc0a8a80d0b885952bf6341f6f0c0140558917664995140d3","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"These cracked boots are caked with a thick layer of mud. It isn't clear who they previously belonged to, but they've clearly seen extensive use.","source_tag":"_t","target":"这对有裂缝的靴子涂着厚厚的一层泥浆。目前还不清楚它以前属于谁，但显然，它曾被很多人使用过。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"60bf720ddadb557294f1204ab4c4f75074670b99f66eece6b00aca40a73c6752","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"5b402d57640945d59c7974d4b250d93d0d1b1d70e960b7485742bfe1e510d166","logical_entry_identity":"0fc95b6ae4ec9258fd09f8d2249f5b7e2efc72daf8077a1dd4b8d42188b2a83f","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"\nYou have completed all the tutorials, and should now know the basics of ToME4. You are ready to step forward into the world to find glory, treasures and be mercilessly slaughtered by hordes of creatures you thought you could handle!\n\nDuring this tutorial some creatures were adjusted according to the needs of the lessons. In the unforgiving world of Eyal, monsters are rarely this nice!\n\nIf you need a reminder of which key does what, you can access the game menu by pressing #GOLD#Escape#WHITE# and checking the key binds. You can also adjust them to suit your needs.\n\nIf this is your first time with the game, you will find the selection of races and classes limited. Don't worry; many, many more will become available as you unlock them during your adventures. \n\nNow go boldly and remember: #GOLD#have fun!#WHITE#\nPress #GOLD#Escape#WHITE#, then select #GOLD#Save and Exit#WHITE#, and create a new character!","source_tag":"_t","target":"你已经完成了所有的教程，现在你对ToME4的基本情况应该有所了解了。你现在已经准备好去世界中寻找荣耀和财富，然后被一大群你以为自己能应付的怪物无情地屠杀！\n\n在教学过程中，一些怪物为了教学目的被相应地做过修改，不过在真实的埃亚尔世界中，怪物可不会这么简单！\n\n要是你想看看你的按键设置细节，你可以按下#GOLD#Esc 键#WHITE#进入游戏菜单检查按键绑定，你可以更改设置直到你满意为止。\n\n如果你第一次接触这个游戏，你会发现可供选择的种族和职业很有限。别担心，随着你在冒险中不断解锁，更多种族和职业将可供选择。\n\n现在，勇敢的前进吧，并且记住：#GOLD#玩的开心！#WHITE#\n按下 #GOLD#Esc 键#WHITE#，选择 #GOLD#保存并退出#WHITE#，然后创建一个新的角色吧！"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"c76149c5c3b7a8ff263ed804e11daf23aa85260094a87b5059a998db33c095f0","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"5b4315f4a61a2a8e8c4c9d48f8d342f80c23cdd55e4a70c5fcac049d0cca1658","logical_entry_identity":"701fc6538cf761ff118ad8bdac75bb087c06f7ae6325489a37b35f8e3605a963","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Blonde Beard 5","source_tag":"_t","target":"金色络腮胡5"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"1070cccfa5057233f869563db6518481e2f19829967056fd2c6212e837b6505e","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"5b48b5fa413119a62e3a3e8e7ce2c8276dacbdebc4ad048b90e41b76739918b3","logical_entry_identity":"7015b8264a46c051d5679572615fad038b5c7a89a5d2f2896f21695b7b7bcc0d","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Press <control> to compare","source_tag":"_t","target":"按住 Ctrl 键比较"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"159bbf72ad3b0fe5d864cf76dd2eaca284b10e3745f68351bff327e837a93ad6","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"5b4a915315af8beee81f2c8077b8f682c6878d6c8a3eaa09fad6e2b151427990","logical_entry_identity":"7be4d7ba654bfd68ba026963995fc23a99ca396080dd9a45dc1cbc0e876e43a3","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"#LIGHT_RED#Atamathon walks the world again, but without control.","source_tag":"log","target":"#LIGHT_RED#阿塔玛森重新来到了世界，不过它失去了控制。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"8c12c57832d29efa8a3904bedf02e4ffa636056b3b0d92453960b691ec09657f","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"5b5e8d4db2b10fff0d5a4f4a001c53c2ae08517faa98602b7765a7b317fd0d0c","logical_entry_identity":"49616ce54c1e1f8e359a5fc45e0f8595fa632b26ddce3d38bfa3f9ba0743cf44","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"\nWorry not, though, Ogre - we can replace your unclean runes with a newly-discovered mixture of infusions, eliminating your dependence on them.  The process will feel...  unpleasant, and will dramatically shorten your lifespan, but you will finally be free from the addictive grip of the arcane!\n","source_tag":"_t","target":"\n不过别担心，食人魔——我们可以用一种新发现的复合纹身配方替换你的不洁符文，让你不再依赖这些符文。这个过程会让你感到……不适，也会大幅缩短你的寿命，但你终将摆脱奥术令人上瘾的控制！\n"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"b63ea6168f9924a51c39b8610341c2f754d4606f24bacc4f44e4f409a05fdbdb","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"5b6140489c1dd14818b2039288f9400a907879d9e3ad6fa3be6ef353ebe63caa","logical_entry_identity":"6b1ad7e0d56e77dcd8650edc9dc847385d7a83f9143d0d1146b849367714f028","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"No Tooltip","source_tag":"_t","target":"没有提示"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"beec2c91279c5ddc8619764236ad4bd5c9ef147862a2a677fe68a7596488bdb9","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"5b6836f4a0eb38acc0d482cc9e21f18d6aaef3e88ff27bcf5d3e8ada6270364b","logical_entry_identity":"41df7975ef5013c81439467627ddbeb595c549bd9f8f29a330c3e3f26604ee24","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"A study of Southspar's most unusual ruler.","source_tag":"_t","target":"有关南晶岛不寻常的统治者的研究。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"138d922b591677f9c5dbfc2ed6a38789cdd2928ae82051f3129f23f195a22185","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"5b69e0ca54edf1e356348e808bdf24571f4ca33a4d2c0f1a0805ec76a53844dc","logical_entry_identity":"75055b81b4cf53b6e83c9d5fe28df88b1ec57fee1cbb3ce5b07b41ceba9799ef","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"This totem of ancient stone oozes a thick slime from myriad cracks. Nonetheless, you sense great power within it."